==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*1 [[Le'noir]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Metal One Horn]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>, delay 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
For this stage it is recomended to bring [[Bombercat]] with a freeze up (M) combo or 2 freeze up (sm) combos to perma freeze Le'noir. There are two windows between Metal One Horn spawns when you can damage the elephant. Use [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] during the first window to quickly burst down a big chunk of it's health. During the second window use your Bombercat with another unit that deals big dps to finish Le'noir. Now you can deal with the last Metal One Horn without issue.

